{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774528683928,"story":{"title":"Zorp's Soggy Surprise","userPrompt":"An alien who has never seen earth before and is going trough the ocean in a submarine she is discovering how diverse the ocean is calling the way her robot says fun facts about each animal they see.","authorStyleId":"roald-dahl","readingLevel":"fluent","illustrationStyleId":"soft_watercolor","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Zorp from planet Glorp was nervous. Her first trip to Earth! She zipped her space suit tighter. Inside her shiny sub, the 'Gurgle-Mobile,' her robot pal, Bolt, whirred. 'Prepare for aquatic entry!' Bolt beeped, far too loud. Zorp winced. 'Tone it down, Bolt! I don't want to scare the sea squids!' Bolt, of course, did not listen.","illustrationPrompt":"Zorp, a small alien with big purple eyes and antennae, sits in a bright yellow submarine. Bolt, a boxy robot with blinking lights, is next to her. The submarine is descending into a swirling blue ocean. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Bright, warm, whimsical.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220362619,"durationMs":6758,"retries":0,"promptLength":953,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with nervous expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with excited (unaware of volume) expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. Zorp, looking nervous, zips up her spacesuit inside the Gurgle-Mobile. Bolt, a robot, is next to her, beeping loudly. in Inside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"The Gurgle-Mobile plunged into the deep. 'Fun fact!' boomed Bolt. 'Ninety-five percent of the ocean remains unexplored!' Zorp gasped. 'Ninety-five percent? Good golly, Bolt! That's like a whole universe of soggy secrets!' She peered out a porthole. 'Blast these bubbles! I can't see a thing!'","illustrationPrompt":"The submarine is surrounded by bubbles. Zorp is peering through a porthole, squinting. Bolt is displaying a large number '95' on his screen. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Bright blues and greens, with pops of yellow from the submarine.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220397943,"durationMs":4783,"retries":0,"promptLength":986,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with frustrated, curious expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. The Gurgle-Mobile plunges into the deep ocean. Zorp peers out a porthole, frustrated by bubbles. in Deep ocean, outside and inside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Suddenly, a school of fish, shimmering like a disco ball, swam past. 'Fun fact!' Bolt declared. 'These are Sardines! They can swim in very large groups!' Zorp clapped her hands. 'They look like a sparkly river! Glorp doesn't have sparkly rivers, only mud puddles. Rather drab, really.'","illustrationPrompt":"A school of shimmering sardines surrounds the submarine. Zorp is smiling and pointing. Bolt is displaying the word 'Sardines'. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Silvers, blues, and greens to emphasize the shimmer of the fish.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220418329,"durationMs":4756,"retries":0,"promptLength":1168,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with excited, amazed expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A small Iridescent silver scales that shimmer like a disco ball fish, small black eyes with neutral (swimming) expression, Shimmering scales, Swim in a large school, Small size, Streamlined bodies, slim build. A school of sardines, shimmering like a disco ball, swims past the Gurgle-Mobile. Zorp claps her hands in excitement. in Deep ocean, outside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"Next, a grumpy-looking pufferfish puffed up like a prickly pear. 'Fun fact!' Bolt shouted. 'The pufferfish inflates to avoid being eaten!' Zorp giggled. 'He looks like he's swallowed a beach ball! Poor grumpy gus.' The pufferfish gave Zorp a suspicious glare.","illustrationPrompt":"A bright yellow pufferfish is puffed up, looking grumpy. Zorp is giggling behind the glass. Bolt is showing an image of a deflated pufferfish next to an inflated one. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Bright yellows, oranges, and blues.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220339399,"durationMs":8938,"retries":0,"promptLength":1089,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with amused expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A small Sandy brown with darker brown spots fish, medium yellow eyes with grumpy, suspicious expression, Puffy body when inflated, Spiky texture, Permanent grumpy expression, Small fins, chubby build. A grumpy-looking pufferfish inflates near the Gurgle-Mobile, glaring suspiciously at Zorp. in Deep ocean, outside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Deeper they went. A giant squid with eyes like saucers zoomed by. 'Fun fact!' Bolt exclaimed. 'Giant squid have the largest eyes in the animal kingdom!' Zorp nearly jumped out of her seat. 'Good gravy! Those are bigger than my head! I hope he doesn't want to play peek-a-boo!'","illustrationPrompt":"A giant squid with enormous eyes is swimming past the submarine. Zorp looks surprised, her eyes wide. Bolt is showing a diagram of a squid eye. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Deep blues and blacks with contrasting white for the squid's eyes.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220335378,"durationMs":4886,"retries":0,"promptLength":1059,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with startled, surprised expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A large Dark reddish-brown squid, huge gold eyes with neutral (swimming) expression, Enormous golden eyes, Long tentacles, Powerful beak, Streamlined body, slim build. A giant squid with large eyes zooms past the Gurgle-Mobile. Zorp looks startled. in Deep ocean, outside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"A family of sea turtles, slow and steady, paddled past. 'Fun fact!' Bolt buzzed. 'Sea turtles can live for over a hundred years!' Zorp smiled. 'A hundred years! That's longer than even Aunt Griselda's prize-winning zucchini! Perhaps they know her secret recipe!'","illustrationPrompt":"A family of sea turtles, a large one and two smaller ones, are swimming gracefully. Zorp is watching them with a warm smile. Bolt is displaying the number '100'. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Greens, browns, and blues to reflect the natural colors of the turtles and the ocean.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220335678,"durationMs":5082,"retries":0,"promptLength":1090,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with thoughtful, curious expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A medium Olive green shell with yellow spots turtle, small black eyes with peaceful (swimming) expression, Slow and steady movement, Ancient appearance, Protective shell, Webbed feet, stocky build. A family of sea turtles paddles past the Gurgle-Mobile. Zorp smiles thoughtfully. in Deep ocean, outside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"Suddenly, the Gurgle-Mobile shuddered. 'Uh oh,' said Bolt. 'Malfunction! We are losing power!' Zorp gripped her seat. 'Not now, Bolt! I haven't even seen a blobfish yet! Are we sinking?' The lights flickered. It was dark.","illustrationPrompt":"The inside of the submarine is dark, with only emergency lights flickering. Zorp looks worried, clutching her seat. Bolt is sparking slightly. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Mostly dark blues and grays with flickering red emergency lights.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220341249,"durationMs":5869,"retries":0,"promptLength":894,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with worried, scared expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with concerned expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. The Gurgle-Mobile shudders and the lights flicker. Zorp grips her seat, worried. Bolt looks concerned. in Inside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"Then, a gentle glow surrounded them. A pod of bioluminescent jellyfish pulsed with light. 'Fun fact!' Bolt squeaked weakly. 'These jellyfish produce their own light!' Zorp gasped. 'They're like underwater fireflies! They saved us!'","illustrationPrompt":"The submarine is surrounded by glowing jellyfish of various colors. Zorp looks amazed and relieved. Bolt is dimly displaying the word 'Bioluminescent'. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Deep blues and purples contrasted with the bright glowing colors of the jellyfish.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220341114,"durationMs":5431,"retries":0,"promptLength":1122,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with amazed, relieved expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with weak, informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A small Translucent with glowing blue bioluminescence jellyfish, None None eyes with neutral (glowing) expression, Bioluminescent glow, Pulsating movement, Delicate tentacles, Translucent body, slim build. A pod of bioluminescent jellyfish surrounds the Gurgle-Mobile, providing light. Zorp gasps in awe. in Deep ocean, surrounding the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"The jellyfish nudged the Gurgle-Mobile towards a coral reef, bursting with color. 'Fun fact!' Bolt managed. 'Coral reefs are home to twenty-five percent of all marine life!' Zorp was speechless. It was like a rainbow under the sea.","illustrationPrompt":"The submarine is near a vibrant coral reef teeming with colorful fish. Zorp is looking out in awe. Bolt is displaying the number '25%'. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: A riot of bright, contrasting colors to showcase the diversity of the coral reef.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220344500,"durationMs":5099,"retries":0,"promptLength":1114,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with speechless, wonder expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A small Translucent with glowing blue bioluminescence jellyfish, None None eyes with helpful (guiding) expression, Bioluminescent glow, Pulsating movement, Delicate tentacles, Translucent body, slim build. The jellyfish guide the Gurgle-Mobile towards a colorful coral reef. Zorp is speechless with wonder. in Near a coral reef in the deep ocean. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"A small clownfish swam up to the window and winked. 'He wants to be friends!' Zorp exclaimed. She pressed her hand against the glass. She missed her family. All of a sudden, Bolt beeped loudly! 'Power restored! Initiating ascent!'","illustrationPrompt":"A clownfish is looking at Zorp through the submarine window and winking. Zorp is smiling and touching the glass. Bolt is glowing brightly. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Bright oranges, whites, and blues.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220344998,"durationMs":3882,"retries":0,"promptLength":1097,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with happy, longing expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A tiny Bright orange with white stripes outlined in black fish, medium black eyes with friendly expression, Bright orange color, White stripes, Friendly wink, Small size, slim build. A small clownfish swims up to the window and winks at Zorp. She presses her hand against the glass. in Near the coral reef, outside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":11,"text":"Back on Glorp, Zorp hugged her parents. 'Earth is amazing! And I made friends with a clownfish!' She showed them pictures Bolt had taken. 'But,' she added, 'it made me miss you both. We should all go next time!' Her parents agreed.","illustrationPrompt":"Zorp is hugging her parents, who are also aliens with purple eyes and antennae. They are looking at pictures of the ocean on a screen. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Warm purples, oranges, and yellows to create a cozy family atmosphere.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220345415,"durationMs":4164,"retries":0,"promptLength":1444,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with happy, excited expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with neutral (displaying pictures) expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A medium light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with loving expression, wearing Simple purple robe with silver trim., with Silver belt, Long, flowing antenna, Kind smile, Similar features to Zorp, Tall and slender build, slim build. A medium light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with loving expression, wearing Simple purple jumpsuit with silver accents., with Silver wristbands, Short, neat antennae, Gentle expression, Similar features to Zorp, Average build, average build. Back on Glorp, Zorp hugs her parents and shows them pictures from her trip. in On planet Glorp, inside a house. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":12,"text":"And so, the whole Glorp family piled into the Gurgle-Mobile. Bolt, of course, blasted fun facts the entire way. This time, Zorp didn't mind. She had her family, the ocean, and even a slightly annoying, but very useful, robot friend. What could be better?","illustrationPrompt":"The Gurgle-Mobile, now bigger, is filled with Zorp and her family. They are all smiling and waving. The submarine is heading back towards Earth. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Bright and cheerful colors, emphasizing the joy of the family adventure.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220349217,"durationMs":4715,"retries":0,"promptLength":1435,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with happy, content expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. A medium Shiny silver metal robot, small blue eyes with informative expression, Boxy shape, Blinking blue lights, Small screen displaying emoticons, Wheels for movement, stocky build. A medium light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with happy expression, wearing Simple purple robe with silver trim., with Silver belt, Long, flowing antenna, Kind smile, Similar features to Zorp, Tall and slender build, slim build. A medium light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with happy expression, wearing Simple purple jumpsuit with silver accents., with Silver wristbands, Short, neat antennae, Gentle expression, Similar features to Zorp, Average build, average build. The whole Glorp family is in the Gurgle-Mobile, ready for another trip to Earth. Zorp smiles. in Inside the Gurgle-Mobile. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.0-flash","imageProvider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220293994,"totalDurationMs":62373,"textGenerationMs":0,"imageGenerationMs":69205,"totalImages":13,"successfulImages":13,"failedImages":0,"appVersion":"2.5.35","buildVersion":"60","firstBatchImageMs":36600,"timeToDisplayMs":36600},"coverImageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220356367,"durationMs":7094,"retries":0,"promptLength":1391,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting Color palette: teal, coral, yellow, purple, silver. A small light lavender skin magical creature, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with curious expression, wearing Purple spacesuit with silver trim and a clear bubble helmet. A small antenna pokes out from the top of the helmet., with Silver gloves and Silver boots, Large, expressive eyes, Small, button nose, Two bouncy blue antennae, Slightly oversized spacesuit, slim build. Book cover for \"Zorp's Soggy Surprise\". Setting: A vibrant, colorful underwater world, ranging from the dark depths to a bright coral reef. The ocean floor is sandy in places, with seaweed forests and rocky formations. The water is generally clear, but sometimes murky with bubbles.. Mood: adventurous, inviting, magical atmosphere. high quality, professional children's book illustration, rich detail, sophisticated but appropriate for children Negative: scary, dark, frightening, violent, blood, gore, weapons, monsters, horror, photorealistic, photo, photograph, realistic human, adult content, nude, complex cluttered, busy overwhelming, text, words, letters, speech bubbles, dialogue bubbles, comic bubbles, captions, watermarks, signatures, labels, titles, distorted faces, extra limbs, deformed, ugly, creepy, nightmare"}},"images":{"cover":"data:image/png;base64,","page-1":"data:image/png;base64,","page-2":"data:image/png;base64,","page-3":"data:image/png;base64,","page-4":"data:image/png;base64,","page-5":"data:image/png;base64,","page-6":"data:image/png;base64,","page-7":"data:image/png;base64,","page-8":"data:image/png;base64,","page-9":"data:image/png;base64,","page-10":"data:image/png;base64,","page-11":"data:image/png;base64,","page-12":"data:image/png;base64,"}}